<h1>Anthony Quezada</h1>
<p>35th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Appointed in 2025, he is seeking his first full term with Chicago DSA&#39;s endorsement, WTTW reported in August 2026. No campaign website or detailed platform found yet.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>35th Ward alderman since 2025 (appointed to succeed Carlos Ramirez-Rosa); Cook County commissioner for the 8th District from 2022 to 2025; former community organizer and constituent services director for Ald. Ramirez-Rosa.</p>
